<h1>Cloud Worker internals</h1>
<p class="lede">Every file of the Cloudflare Worker, what it does, and how a request or a cron tick travels through it.</p>

<h2>The two doors into the Worker</h2>
<p>A Worker is a JavaScript module that exports handlers. Cloudflare calls them:</p>
<pre><code>// cloud/src/index.ts
export default {
  async fetch(req, env) {                         // every HTTP request
    const url = new URL(req.url);
    if (url.pathname.startsWith('/api/') || url.pathname.startsWith('/auth/')) {
      try { assertConfigured(env); return await handleApi(req, env, url); }
      catch (e) { return errorResponse(e); }
    }
    return env.ASSETS.fetch(req);                 // everything else: static files
  },
  async scheduled(event, env, ctx) {              // the cron trigger, every minute
    ctx.waitUntil(runTick(env, event.scheduledTime).then(logSummary));
  },
};</code></pre>
<div class="callout info"><span class="callout-title">Static files usually skip the Worker</span>With <code>run_worker_first: ["/api/*", "/auth/*"]</code> in <code>wrangler.jsonc</code>, Cloudflare serves files such as <code>/index.html</code> or <code>/js/main.js</code> directly from its asset storage. Those requests are free and do not count against the 100,000 daily Worker requests. Only API and sign-in paths run our code.</div>

<h2>A request's path through the files</h2>
<script type="application/json" class="diagram" data-kind="flow" data-caption="Request pipeline inside the Worker for GET /api/mine.">
{"w": 820, "h": 300,
 "nodes": [
  {"id": "idx", "x": 20, "y": 30, "w": 160, "title": "index.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "route + config check"},
  {"id": "csrf", "x": 220, "y": 30, "w": 170, "title": "http.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "assertSameOrigin()"},
  {"id": "sess", "x": 430, "y": 30, "w": 170, "title": "auth.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "requireSession()"},
  {"id": "rl", "x": 640, "y": 30, "w": 160, "title": "http.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "rateLimit(user)"},
  {"id": "tok", "x": 640, "y": 150, "w": 160, "title": "auth.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "accessToken()"},
  {"id": "api", "x": 430, "y": 150, "w": 170, "title": "auth.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "cloudApi() → JiraApi"},
  {"id": "core", "x": 220, "y": 150, "w": 170, "title": "core/jira.ts", "kind": "db", "sub": "getMyBugs()"},
  {"id": "resp", "x": 20, "y": 150, "w": 160, "title": "http.ts", "kind": "cf", "sub": "json(result)"},
  {"id": "d1", "x": 430, "y": 250, "w": 170, "h": 36, "title": "D1", "icon": "🗄", "kind": "db"},
